    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that, but i've had flashes like this before and they just went away, so i feel like i'm overreacting. i'm just so stressed about this presentation and the thought of sitting in an ER for 6 hours is making my head spin. is there like a certain eye drop or something i could use to help clear up the spots so i can just get through tomorrow? maybe something to reduce inflammation or just help the vision settle?",
